\pard\sa120\cf1 1.1 Do not use the Software, or any value it produces, as the basis for a clinical, diagnostic, therapeutic or other patient-care decision.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 1.2 Do not use the Software to produce results that will be reported to a patient, to a clinician acting for a patient, to an insurer, or to a regulator as a clinical finding.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 1.3 The regression fits, standard curves, derived concentrations, rate constants, saturation values and reports the Software computes are the output of general-purpose numerical methods applied to numbers you supplied. They carry no guarantee of analytical accuracy, precision, linearity, limit of detection, or fitness for any particular assay.\par
