\pard\sb200\sa120\cf1\b 6. Your data\b0\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 6.1 Easy OKAPI is local-first. Your measurement files, calibration curves, analysis snapshots, reports and interaction logs are written to your own machine and are not uploaded to us in normal operation.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 6.2 Your data is yours. We claim no ownership over it, we do not use it for our own research, and we do not use it to train any machine-learning model.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 6.3 What the Software does send to us \u8212? the licence token and hardware fingerprint, update checks, assistant messages when you use the hosted assistant, and bug reports you choose to send \u8212? is itemised in legal/PRIVACY.md.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 6.4 Do not put patient identifiers or other personal data into file names, source labels, report subjects or assistant prompts. The Software is not designed to hold personal health information.\par
\pard\sa120\cf1 6.5 You are responsible for backing up your data. Uninstalling the Software, or letting an update fail, may remove files in the application directory.\par
